Project: {{config.metadata.name}} ({{stack}} / {{architecture}})
Doc language: {{language}}

Help register a legacy system integration (SOAP, mainframe, fixed-format files).
Return ONLY a JSON object — no Markdown fences, no prose.

User input:
"""
{{extra.userDescription}}
"""

Schema:
{
  "name": string,
  "vendor": string,
  "purpose": string,
  "endpoints": [{ "name": string, "protocol": string, "url": string }],
  "slaTargets": { "availability": string, "latencyP95Ms": number },
  "auth": { "mode": string, "secretsRef": string },
  "errorHandling": string,
  "rateLimits": string,
  "observability": string,
  "versioning": string,
  "extra": {
    "protocol": string,    // "SOAP", "MQ", "SFTP", "FIX", ...
    "format": string,      // "WSDL", "EBCDIC fixed", ...
    "notes": string
  }
}

Constraints:
- Do NOT include "id".
- Note brittleness, change-management cadence, downtime windows.

Return JSON only.
